msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"So you wanna know who gave me the hookup with that guy Suzuki, huh? He's "
"some kinda minister or some shit, right? Well... it was Hamazaki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Yup. He's been tryin' to poke his grubby little fingers into\r\n"
"that Okinawa deal ever since he learned the Tojo were\r\n"
"helping scrounge up the land for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "But Daigo walked, right? What was poor ol' Hamazaki gonna do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Take matters into his own hands, that's what. Pick up where\r\n"
"Daigo left off, snatch up rights to the resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"So he phoned up Suzuki, boasted about havin' bigger balls\r\n"
"than the Tojo, and that was that. Game-set, Hamazaki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "And that's when he offered you the construction contract?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Yup. Didn't make sense why he'd come to me with such a juicy\r\n"
"offer..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "But it's all crystal fuckin' clear now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-chan. Ya saw that photo of me and Suzuki chummin'\r\n"
"around, right? I got a damn good idea of who let it slip.\r\n"
"Hamazaki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "But why?"
msgstr "Ma perché?"

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"It proves someone was dealin' with Suzuki on behalf of\r\n"
"the Tojo... and that this \"someone\" was me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"That kinda shit hits the news, me and Suzuki would be in\r\n"
"the slammer quicker than you can say false imprisonment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"All Hamazaki'd have to do then is swoop in and clean up\r\n"
"the scraps. He'd make a damn killin'. Enough to stop him\r\n"
"blowing up any more Chinese joints, that's for sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Sounds like he's more vulture than man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Yup. That resort shit's not the only thing he's gunnin' for,\r\n"
"either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "There's more?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Ohhh yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"Last time I was with him, he looked me square in the eye...\r\n"
"Said he wanted Kamurocho all to himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Only one way to interpret that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Which is what?"
msgstr "E cioè?"

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Think about it, Kiryu-chan. Daigo and Kashiwagi get filled\r\n"
"with lead, you beat the snot outta Kanda... The whole city's\r\n"
"fair game, and Hamazaki's ready to pounce."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "But how could he have known all that would happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Ya ask me, he planned it from the start. Everything fallin' into place so "
"perfectly is just a teeensy bit too convenient, don't ya think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "I guess. And his ultimate goal is taking over Kamurocho?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Not just that. There's one more head in his crosshairs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "...The Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5772"
msgid "Majima"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5776"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""
